0:50:23Z","updated_at":"2026-10-12T14:33:05Z","closed_at":"2026-10-12T14:33:05Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nGodot 4.8 dev 7 Mono\nGit commit hash: c971f93e7\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11 - Godot v4.8.dev7.Mono - Vulcan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1650 (617.42) Intel Core i5-10400 @2.90GHz (12 Threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen running a project using the Embedded Game Window, displaying a `Window` node with sub-embedding disabled causes a large gray rectangle to appear over the embedded game window.\n\nThe `Window` is intentionally configured not to be embedded. The issue occurs when the window is displayed while the game itself is running inside Godot's Embedded Game Window.\n\nThe first screenshot shows the expected appearance of the error dialog. The second screenshot shows the issue, where a large gray rectangle appears and covers part of the embedded game window.\n\n**First Screenshot**\n<img width=\"789\" height=\"443\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/eff4c1fe-b595-4700-bcdc-edb03538178b\" />\n\n**Second Screenshot**\n<img width=\"1432\" height=\"772\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ca75b2e4-18fa-494e-b4e8-b2fa99b66226\" />\n\nThe `Window` is used by my project to display an error dialog. The code that triggers the error is part of my own framework (`TestService` and `Utility`) and is not part of Godot.\n\nExpected behavior:\nThe non-embedded `Window` should be displayed normally without causing a large gray rectangle to appear over the Embedded Game Window.\n\nThe only fix is Resize the window because im sure need a redraw the window.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Open a Godot project.\n2. Enable the Embedded Game Window.\n3. Create or use a `Window` node.\n4. Disable sub-embedding in ProjectSettings/display/window/subwindows/embed_subwindows\n5. Run the project in the Embedded Game Window.\n7. Observe the area around the embedded game window.\n\nA large gray rectangle appears over part of the Embedded Game Window.\nOr well the background color is choosed\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[WindowGrayBoxWithSubemmbedDisabled.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/33224462/WindowGrayBoxWithSubemmbedDisabled.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124306/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124306/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}